message: "Please cite the version of Image Annotator used to annotate your images."
title: "Image Annotator"
authors:
  - name: "Image Annotator contributors"
version: "1.0.2"
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: "A local crop image annotation application for drawing boxes and polygons, measuring their projected areas from an image scale, and linking green-area estimates and object counts to sample records."
keywords:
